the transcript be in?\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-bold leading-7 text-gray-900\",\"children\":\"Which language will the transcript be in?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 leading-7 text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"It starts in the video's own caption language, which is usually the language it was spoken in. A Language list above the text lets you switch to another language.\"}]]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"article\",\"Can I translate a YouTube transcript into another language?\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-bold leading-7 text-gray-900\",\"children\":\"Can I translate a YouTube transcript into another language?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 leading-7 text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"Yes. Pick a language from the list after the transcript loads. If the creator uploaded captions in that language you get those. Otherwise the text is translated automatically, so the wording can be rough, especially when the original captions were auto-generated. Very long videos may be too long to translate.\"}]]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"article\",\"Can I reuse a transcript in my own content?\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-bold leading-7 text-gray-900\",\"children\":\"Can I reuse a transcript in my own content?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 leading-7 text-gray-600\",\"children\":\"A transcript is the creator's words, so it stays their copyright. It's fine for reading, notes, research and accessibility. Ask for permission before you republish it or sell it.\"}]]}]\n19:T901,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I get the transcript of a YouTube video?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Copy the video's link, paste it into the box above and press Get Transcript. The text appears below the video thumbnail, and you can copy it or download it as a .txt file.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does this work on videos without captions?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The transcript comes from the captions YouTube already has for the video, either uploaded by the creator or generated automatically. If a video has no captions, there's nothing to show, and this tool doesn't turn audio into text on its own.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I see timestamps in the transcript?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Switch Timestamps to ON and every line gets the time it starts. The Copy and Download buttons follow whichever mode is active.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why does a video show an error?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The usual reasons are that captions are turned off, the video is private, deleted or restricted in some regions, or YouTube is limiting requests for a few minutes. Try again later or test another video.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which language will the transcript be in?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It starts in the video's own caption language, which is usually the language it was spoken in. A Language list above the text lets you switch to another language.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I translate a YouTube transcript into another language?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Pick a language from the list after the transcript loads. If the creator uploaded captions in that language you get those. Otherwise the text is translated automatically, so the wording can be rough, especially when the original captions were auto-generated. Very long videos may be too long to translate.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I reuse a transcript in my own content?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A transcript is the creator's words, so it stays their copyright. It's fine for reading, notes, research and accessibility. Ask for permission before you republish it or sell it.\"}}]}a:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$19\"}}]\nb:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebApplication\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"YouTube Transcript Generator\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://youtubethumbnails-downloader.com/youtube-transcript\\\",\\\"applicationCategory\\\":\\\"MultimediaApplication\\\",\\\"operatingSystem\\\":\\\"Any\\\",\\\"browserRequirements\\\":\\\"Requires JavaScript and a modern HTML5-compatible browser.\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Free online tool that fetches the transcript of a YouTube video from its captions, with optional timestamps and a text download.\\\",\\\"offers\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Offer\\\",\\\"price\\\":\\\"0\\\",\\\"priceCurrency\\\":\\\"USD\\\"}}\"}}]\nc:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/23p7n_1bmtxg_.js\",\"async\":true}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1b\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@1c\"}]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1b\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"YouTube Transcript Generator: Free Video to Text\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Paste a YouTube link and get the video's transcript as text. Switch language, show timestamps, copy it or download a .txt file. Free, no sign-up.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"application-name\",\"content\":\"YouTube Thumbnail Downloader\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"author\",\"href\":\"https://youtubethumbnails-downloa